# ============================================================================
# Swag code formatter configuration
# ============================================================================
# The canonical Swag style is built into the compiler, and it is the style this
# code base is written in, so there is nothing to repeat here. Run
# `swc format --dump-config` to print the whole resolved configuration as a
# ready-to-edit `.swc-format` file, and `swc format --style preserve` to
# normalize nothing at all.
#
# One departure, and it belongs to the checkout rather than to the style. Line
# endings are a property of the working tree, so the built-in style preserves
# them; this tree is checked out with CRLF (`.gitattributes`), and pinning the
# value at the root repairs the files that an editor or a bulk tool silently
# rewrote to LF - under `bin/` and under `tools/` alike.
end-of-line-style = crlf
